        "type": "the-purpose",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "This topic set is designed to provide a comprehensive exploration of higher-order cognitive skills, specifically focusing on **Critical Thinking, Divergent Thinking, and Critical Problem-Solving**. The topics are structured to answer your specific questions about the techniques, implementation, and common pitfalls associated with these skills. They investigate the developmental path from novice to expert, analyze best practices for general self-development, and explore the crucial integration of these processes within a Personal Knowledge Base (Personal Knowledge Base) like Obsidian. Finally, the set explicitly connects these cognitive frameworks to the principles of Andragogy (Adult Learning) to provide a holistic understanding.",
        "line_number": 32,
        "source": "topic-set_topics-on-higher-order-cognition-and-pkb-integration_🆔20251026133044.md",
